The set "office-jpx" (written by nr-office-pdf-jpx-codestream, MANIFEST.json sha256 b32ae78d9d9c9b5ff9d70770a3a0f0af6b84aa9432bd38cc0bc3a21637d740df) has no row in the index in
the integration tree at the time of writing; if it still has none, add it too (fileCount 20, see its MANIFEST.json).

## 4. SERVICE_PENDING / protocol

No protocol method, no compose_flip.rs change, nothing to remove from SERVICE_PENDING.
